{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "orderhub-auth-collection",
    "name": "OrderHub — OAuth 2.0 Authentication Tests",
    "description": "Testes completos do fluxo de autenticação OAuth 2.0 (client_credentials) do OrderHub.\n\nFase 02a: Login com JWT validado pelo Keycloak.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1️⃣ Keycloak Health",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:8180/realms/orderhub/.well-known/openid-configuration",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "8180",
          "path": ["realms", "orderhub", ".well-known", "openid-configuration"]
        },
        "description": "Verifica se o Keycloak está respondendo com os metadados OIDC.\n\nEsperado: `200` com JSON contendo endpoints do Keycloak."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "2️⃣ Obter Access Token (client_credentials)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.environment.set('access_token', jsonData.access_token);",
              "    pm.environment.set('token_type', jsonData.token_type);",
              "    pm.environment.set('expires_in', jsonData.expires_in);",
              "    ",
              "    pm.test('Token obtido com sucesso', function () {",
              "        pm.expect(jsonData.access_token).to.exist;",
              "        pm.expect(jsonData.token_type).to.equal('Bearer');",
              "        pm.expect(jsonData.expires_in).to.equal(300);",
              "    });",
              "} else {",
              "    pm.test('Erro ao obter token', function () {",
              "        pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200);",
              "    });",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            {
              "key": "grant_type",
              "value": "client_credentials"
            },
            {
              "key": "client_id",
              "value": "orderhub-cli"
            },
            {
              "key": "client_secret",
              "value": "orderhub-cli-dev-secret"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:8180/realms/orderhub/protocol/openid-connect/token",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "8180",
          "path": ["realms", "orderhub", "protocol", "openid-connect", "token"]
        },
        "description": "Obtém um access token usando client_credentials.\n\nCliente: `orderhub-cli`\nSecret: `orderhub-cli-dev-secret`\n\nEsperado: `200` com JSON contendo `access_token`, `token_type: Bearer`, `expires_in: 300`\n\nO token é salvo automaticamente em `{{access_token}}` para usar nos próximos testes."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "3️⃣ GET /catalog/v1/products — SEM token (401)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Acesso negado sem token (401)', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(401);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:5000/catalog/v1/products",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "5000",
          "path": ["catalog", "v1", "products"]
        },
        "description": "Tenta acessar a API sem enviar um token.\n\nEsperado: `401 Unauthorized` (API rejeita anônimos)"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "4️⃣ GET /catalog/v1/products — COM token (200)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Acesso autorizado com token (200)', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Resposta é um array de produtos', function () {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.be.an('array');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.length).to.be.greaterThan(0);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Produtos têm estrutura correta', function () {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    jsonData.forEach(function(product) {",
              "        pm.expect(product).to.have.property('id');",
              "        pm.expect(product).to.have.property('name');",
              "        pm.expect(product).to.have.property('price');",
              "    });",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:5000/catalog/v1/products",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "5000",
          "path": ["catalog", "v1", "products"]
        },
        "description": "Acessa a API com um token JWT válido.\n\nEsperado: `200` com JSON array de produtos com estrutura:\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"...\",\n    \"name\": \"Keyboard\",\n    \"price\": 79.99\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"...\",\n    \"name\": \"Mouse\",\n    \"price\": 24.99\n  }\n]\n```"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "5️⃣ Gateway Health",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Gateway está ready (200)', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:5000/health/ready",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "5000",
          "path": ["health", "ready"]
        },
        "description": "Verifica se o Gateway está pronto (health check).\n\nEsperado: `200` (Gateway operacional)"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "6️⃣ Catalog Health",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Catalog está ready (200)', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:5001/health/ready",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "5001",
          "path": ["health", "ready"]
        },
        "description": "Verifica se o Catalog está pronto (health check).\n\nEsperado: `200` (Catalog operacional)"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "7️⃣ Decodificar JWT (debug)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "var token = pm.environment.get('access_token');",
              "var parts = token.split('.');",
              "var payload = parts[1];",
              "",
              "while (payload.length % 4) {",
              "    payload += '=';",
              "}",
              "",
              "var decoded = atob(payload);",
              "var claims = JSON.parse(decoded);",
              "",
              "pm.environment.set('jwt_iss', claims.iss);",
              "pm.environment.set('jwt_aud', claims.aud);",
              "pm.environment.set('jwt_sub', claims.sub);",
              "pm.environment.set('jwt_scope', claims.scope);",
              "pm.environment.set('jwt_exp', claims.exp);",
              "pm.environment.set('jwt_iat', claims.iat);",
              "",
              "pm.test('Token contém issuer correto', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(claims.iss).to.equal('http://localhost:8180/realms/orderhub');",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Token contém audience correto', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(claims.aud).to.equal('orderhub-api');",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Token contém scopes', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(claims.scope).to.include('catalog.read');",
              "    pm.expect(claims.scope).to.include('catalog.write');",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Token contém expiration', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(claims.exp).to.exist;",
              "    var now = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000);",
              "    pm.expect(claims.exp).to.be.greaterThan(now);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:8180/realms/orderhub/.well-known/openid-configuration",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "8180",
          "path": ["realms", "orderhub", ".well-known", "openid-configuration"]
        },
        "description": "Decodifica o JWT armazenado em `{{access_token}}`."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "8️⃣ Testar token expirado (executar após 300s)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 401) {",
              "    pm.test('Token expirado corretamente rejeitado (401)', function () {",
              "        pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(401);",
              "    });",
              "} else {",
              "    pm.test('AVISO: Token ainda é válido (execute este teste após 300 segundos)', function () {",
              "        pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(401);",
              "    });",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:5000/catalog/v1/products",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "5000",
          "path": ["catalog", "v1", "products"]
        },
        "description": "Testa se o token é rejeitado após expirar.\n\n⏱️ **Execute este teste APÓS 300 segundos (5 minutos) do teste #2**\n\nEsperado: `401 Unauthorized` (token expirado)"
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ],
